      "japanese": "ロシアの南、イランの北にあり、首都バクーはカスピ海に面している。",
      "english_translation": "Located south of Russia and north of Iran, with its capital Baku facing the Caspian Sea."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 2,
      "japanese": "バクーではいつも、カスピ海からの風が町中を吹いている。",
      "english_translation": "In Baku, the wind from the Caspian Sea is always blowing through the city."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "私がバクーに住み始めたのは、5月だった。",
      "english_translation": "I started living in Baku in May."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "いいときにいらっしゃいましたね。",
      "english_translation": "It's nice to have you here at this time."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "5月の公園には、この国の人が大好きなバラの花が咲き乱れていた。",
      "english_translation": "In May, roses were blooming all over the park, and they were a favorite flower of people in this country."
    }
